                <pb facs="0361" n="354" xml:id="pg354"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">793.94/9221: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Consul at Tsingtao</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Sokobin</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1937-08-07T16:00:00-04:00">August 7, 1937—4 p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Your August 7, 11 a.m., and previous on same subject. By way of caution,
                    Department feels that American official agencies should be on guard against
                    giving any impression of attempting to influence Chinese authorities in relation
                    to questions of military operations.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
